VITE_SUPABASE_URL=your_supabase_project_url
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_supabase_anon_key

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Google Integration — NOT USED (src/services/google/ has zero importers;
# see CLAUDE.md "Dead code" rule and OFFLINE_ROADMAP.md §12). Do not set
# these unless that integration is re-enabled.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SECURITY WARNING (updated 2026-07-25, Phase 1 of SECURITY-HARDENING.md):
# every VITE_-prefixed variable is bundled into the public client-side JS —
# anyone who downloads the site can read it. A Google service-account
# PRIVATE KEY must NEVER go in a VITE_ variable. GOOGLE_INTEGRATION_SETUP.md
# describes a service-account flow that would do exactly that; the backup
# system actually deployed (functions/api/, scripts/backup/) instead uses
# OAuth refresh-token credentials kept server-side only, as
# GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID / GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET /
# GOOGLE_OAUTH_REFRESH_TOKEN / GOOGLE_DRIVE_FOLDER_ID — set as encrypted
# Cloudflare Pages env vars (see API.md §2), never as VITE_ vars.
